        <h3 class="theme-color">Education</h3>
        <hr class="theme-color-bg-secondary" />
        <p>I graduated from Cal Poly San Luis Obispo in 2014 with a BS in Graphic Communications and a concentration in Web &amp; Digital Media. My curriculum taught me the best design practices for digital and print. During my time at Cal Poly I found my love for making websites. Cal Poly has a hands on learning environment with a motto of learn by doing. After getting a taste for the exciting world of web development in Cal Poly's first hackathon, I decided to create my own club. My senior year I co-founded the Creative Media Development Club (⌘CMD) to help sponsor future hackathons as well as help teach other students web development.</p>
      </div>

