        </div>
        <div class="grid-half">
          <p>I built this site in order to share some of my work, experiences, and thoughts with you all. Check out my <a href="/blog">blog</a> for some cool front-end tips, tricks, and tutorials! I'm a pretty laid back guy and am easy to work with, so if you have any questions or wanna work together, shoot me a <a href="mailto:kknopper@gmail.com">line</a>! Catch you on the flip side.</p>
